Gyu-sik en este momento?

952
01:03:17,480 --> 01:03:18,640
Mis primeras palabras…

953
01:03:23,360 --> 01:03:24,440
mis primeras palabras

954
01:03:25,610 --> 01:03:27,740
frente a la gente

955
01:03:28,610 --> 01:03:30,280
